WEBVTT

00:01.910 --> 00:07.230
The founder of Ozmargo—our first king—
and his queen consort.

00:07.890 --> 00:14.230
Endless power struggles consumed beastkind 
until this great hero united us.

00:14.230 --> 00:16.150
First king, hero!

00:16.660 --> 00:20.110
And his queen took up a 
sword to guard his back.

00:20.980 --> 00:23.360
I knew about them from history books,

00:23.360 --> 00:25.570
but it's still kind of amazing to see.

00:26.140 --> 00:30.090
Still, I had no idea this 
statue was in the palace.

00:30.090 --> 00:33.210
I've never been allowed in here, 
even for Duke Galois's visit.

00:33.210 --> 00:35.200
This is a sacred place.

00:35.200 --> 00:38.730
It's only opened for royal 
birthdays and coronations,

00:38.730 --> 00:41.810
or in the lead-up to the Grand Consecration.

00:41.810 --> 00:42.980
What's that?

00:43.230 --> 00:46.770
Officially, it's the "Grand Consecration 
in Memory of Ozmargo's Founding."

00:46.770 --> 00:49.350
Not only royalty and nobility 
from vassal states,

00:49.350 --> 00:54.240
but also the common people of Ozmargo 
gather in the palace for a grand celebration.

00:54.240 --> 00:58.040
No wonder everyone here 
has been so busy lately.

00:58.040 --> 01:00.770
I haven't seen His Majesty all day.

01:00.770 --> 01:04.080
His Majesty must be having his regalia fitted.

01:04.310 --> 01:05.360
What regalia?

01:05.360 --> 01:08.690
During the rites of the Grand Consecration,

01:08.690 --> 01:11.360
kings customarily wear 
the first king's clothes.

01:11.360 --> 01:13.880
And one day, Sari, 
you'll wear the first queen's—

01:13.880 --> 01:15.380
The king is dressing up?

01:15.380 --> 01:16.710
Okay! Let's go take a look!

01:16.710 --> 01:17.610
What?

01:18.640 --> 01:20.880
W-Wait, Sari!

01:20.880 --> 01:22.210
Ri!

02:53.020 --> 02:58.030
Day of Festival and Revelation

02:58.400 --> 03:00.490
Sari, no!

03:00.490 --> 03:04.110
His Majesty will be furious 
if you spy on him dressing!

03:04.110 --> 03:07.340
But I want to see what he's going to wear!

03:08.290 --> 03:11.260
Hello. Are you here, Your Majesty?

03:11.830 --> 03:14.300
Sariphi? What is it?

03:16.180 --> 03:19.080
I came to see you try on your fancy clothes.

03:19.780 --> 03:22.410
Will you wear that to 
the Grand Consecration?

03:22.410 --> 03:23.600
Yes. Why?

03:23.600 --> 03:25.360
Oh, wow!

03:25.360 --> 03:27.820
You look so dashing, like a real hero!

03:27.820 --> 03:29.470
I love it, sire!

03:33.800 --> 03:36.510
All but Sariphi, leave us.

03:36.510 --> 03:37.390
Y-Yes, sire.

03:38.290 --> 03:39.240
Sire?

03:39.240 --> 03:40.070
What's—

03:43.280 --> 03:46.090
<i>Oh, is he embar—</i>

03:48.130 --> 03:50.630
You really do look great, sire!

03:53.740 --> 03:55.760
The wind sure is strong today.

03:56.290 --> 03:59.130
The skies will grow even more turbulent

03:59.130 --> 04:03.730
until, at last, a storm drives 
the miasma from the realm.

04:04.020 --> 04:07.420
I believe this will be a night of revelation.

04:07.940 --> 04:13.210
<i>A night of revelation... When His Majesty 
loses his beast form and powers...</i>

04:21.610 --> 04:24.550
<i>This weak circle isn't even a consolation.</i>

04:25.110 --> 04:27.890
<i>But this is my limit in human form.</i>

04:27.890 --> 04:29.840
<i>If I'm found like this...</i>

04:34.110 --> 04:35.540
Oh, thank goodness!

04:35.950 --> 04:37.510
I found you, Leo.

04:37.510 --> 04:38.750
Sariphi...

04:39.920 --> 04:44.680
Amit taught me how to bake these, 
and I wanted to eat them with you.

04:45.050 --> 04:46.680
And you have a long night ahead of you.

04:50.370 --> 04:52.050
I am... frightened.

04:52.510 --> 04:57.050
I cannot survive here without 
my power as the king of beasts.

04:57.800 --> 05:04.290
In this all-too-fragile, incomplete form, 
I can only hold my breath in the dark.

05:06.070 --> 05:10.350
Once the beasts all accept me, a human,

05:10.350 --> 05:13.170
I'm sure you won't have 
to hide like this anymore.

05:13.520 --> 05:15.870
So have faith and be patient.

05:17.500 --> 05:19.370
Touch my hand.

05:21.550 --> 05:22.300
Well?

05:22.690 --> 05:23.670
It feels normal.

05:24.150 --> 05:28.660
To my shame, on the night before 
every previous Grand Consecration,

05:28.660 --> 05:31.190
my fingers would grow cold and tremble.

05:32.670 --> 05:34.320
Because you were nervous?

05:34.980 --> 05:36.900
About appearing at the ceremony?

05:36.900 --> 05:39.800
Yes. And not only the Grand Consecration.

05:40.260 --> 05:42.770
I always felt that way 
before facing my people.

05:44.170 --> 05:46.670
Knowing their countless gazes 
would bore into me at once,

05:47.180 --> 05:50.110
I feared that one day, someone would see me

05:50.560 --> 05:55.880
for the empty, impure king I am, 
and that I would lose everything.

05:57.830 --> 05:59.620
But now I have you.

06:00.450 --> 06:03.160
My fingers no longer grow cold or tremble.

06:03.740 --> 06:08.080
Even if you aren't at my side tomorrow, 
I can sense your heart.

06:08.690 --> 06:11.850
I'm always under your protection.

06:14.360 --> 06:18.190
Come closer. Keep me warm.

06:18.950 --> 06:19.840
<i>Leo.</i>

06:20.360 --> 06:23.590
<i>I'm always protected by your kindness, too.</i>

06:24.040 --> 06:29.400
<i>I may not be able to stand at 
your side now, but one day...</i>

06:37.160 --> 06:38.620
Good morning, Leo.

06:40.240 --> 06:41.120
<i>Huh?</i>

06:41.470 --> 06:42.620
<i>Human?</i>

06:44.830 --> 06:47.770
<i>He's still in human form? Why?</i>

06:47.770 --> 06:48.800
<i>What should I do?!</i>

06:49.850 --> 06:54.470
Hey, Dad, why's the sky blue?

06:54.470 --> 06:57.930
Now this is a rare sight. 
It must have been centuries

06:58.340 --> 07:01.510
since the revelation last 
persisted past daybreak.

07:02.140 --> 07:06.980
So, because last night's storm 
blew all the miasma away,

07:06.980 --> 07:09.050
you can't turn back into a beast?

07:09.050 --> 07:10.860
That's the only explanation I can think of.

07:11.250 --> 07:14.070
Then... you'll be stuck 
in human form forever?

07:14.460 --> 07:18.070
The miasma will begin to fill 
the air again, given time.

07:18.510 --> 07:23.090
Then my magic will return naturally, 
and I'll regain my beastly form.

07:23.400 --> 07:27.330
Really? In that case, all you 
need to do is hide until then.

07:27.980 --> 07:28.950
Not quite.

07:29.630 --> 07:31.630
Haven't you located His Majesty yet?!

07:31.630 --> 07:34.240
He isn't in his chambers.

07:34.240 --> 07:37.890
Nor in the audience chamber! 
Nor in the great hall!

07:37.890 --> 07:41.360
But the ceremony is beginning 
in less than an hour!

07:41.590 --> 07:46.120
Lady Sariphi is missing, as well. 
What in the world could have happened?

07:46.120 --> 07:47.790
Sari!

07:47.790 --> 07:50.610
The bell to ring in the Grand Consecration

07:50.880 --> 07:56.070
sounds twelve times at the exact hour 
our first king proclaimed this realm.

07:56.070 --> 07:59.990
No king in our history been so 
much as a second late for it.

07:59.990 --> 08:01.780
We cannot let this be the first time!

08:02.280 --> 08:06.360
Already, many subjects eagerly 
await His Majesty's arrival.

08:06.360 --> 08:08.490
Search every nook and cranny of the palace!

08:08.490 --> 08:11.590
B-But, my Lord Chancellor, 
we've done all we can.

08:11.590 --> 08:14.330
Have you searched below ground?

08:14.920 --> 08:15.760
Set.

08:15.960 --> 08:21.970
The subterranean altar chamber 
is ordinarily off limits.

08:21.970 --> 08:26.390
Where better to meditate before 
a ritual of great importance?

08:26.390 --> 08:31.290
And perhaps His Majesty has 
simply lost track of the time.

08:31.860 --> 08:33.350
Lord Chancellor...

08:34.370 --> 08:35.310
Very well.

08:35.690 --> 08:38.470
This is an emergency. 
I'll assume responsibility.

08:38.470 --> 08:40.030
We shall go to the altar.

08:41.490 --> 08:43.700
Your Majesty! Are you here?!

08:43.700 --> 08:44.470
Your Majesty!

08:45.090 --> 08:47.200
We've no choice. Force it open!

08:47.200 --> 08:47.880
Yes, sir!

08:52.330 --> 08:54.340
He's not here, either?

08:54.340 --> 08:55.090
Let us go!

09:03.970 --> 09:06.070
Wow, a secret passage!

09:06.960 --> 09:10.780
Is this how you let sacrifices escape, sire?

09:11.970 --> 09:14.640
I never dreamed I'd use it myself.

09:24.150 --> 09:26.290
How have we still not found him?

09:26.710 --> 09:29.340
Where can His Majesty have gone?

09:31.500 --> 09:33.280
Ah! You startled me!

09:33.280 --> 09:35.010
No, <i>you</i> startled <i>us</i>!

09:35.010 --> 09:36.820
Where did you come from?

09:36.820 --> 09:38.380
C-Captain...

09:38.380 --> 09:41.130
Lady Human. Isn't His Majesty with you?

09:41.130 --> 09:45.180
W-Well, you see, I've been l-looking 
for him all morning, too.

09:45.180 --> 09:46.720
But it looks like he's not over here.

09:46.720 --> 09:48.060
Yup! Nowhere in sight!

09:51.420 --> 09:52.520
I see.

09:52.860 --> 09:53.870
Let's go.

09:58.980 --> 10:00.440
The coast is clear.

10:00.700 --> 10:02.160
But we're still in danger here.

10:02.690 --> 10:05.860
Is there nowhere else we can hide?

10:08.320 --> 10:12.430
They've already searched here, 
so it should be fine.

10:13.280 --> 10:14.130
Leo?

10:18.710 --> 10:20.970
What's wrong, Leo? Hang in there!

10:28.340 --> 10:31.620
Leo! You're turning back into a beast.

10:32.520 --> 10:35.070
Thank goodness! Now you can 
make it to the ceremony.

10:35.850 --> 10:39.480
No, the bell will start to ring at any moment.

10:39.870 --> 10:43.530
Even if I regain my beastly form by then,

10:43.530 --> 10:49.450
I can't possibly dress and make my entrance 
before the twelve chimes end.

10:49.450 --> 10:52.410
Don't say that! I know we can find a way!

10:52.410 --> 10:53.770
You don't understand.

10:54.890 --> 10:58.540
Even if I'm in time, would it be right?

10:59.230 --> 11:01.530
Does a king who troubles 
those he ought to protect

11:01.530 --> 11:04.280
because he can't control his own form

11:04.780 --> 11:07.340
have any right to stand before his people?

11:10.780 --> 11:11.640
Leo,

11:12.210 --> 11:15.740
I think you're a truly great king.

11:16.200 --> 11:21.940
But not because you look strong 
or wear magnificent armor.

11:22.870 --> 11:23.830
Look.

11:25.280 --> 11:26.770
You've stopped trembling.

11:31.890 --> 11:33.140
What's wrong?

11:33.140 --> 11:34.100
Someone's coming!

11:34.770 --> 11:37.440
I'll delay them. Trust me.

11:37.440 --> 11:38.250
Sari...

11:51.920 --> 11:54.130
Why, Lady Sariphi.

11:54.550 --> 11:58.170
I don't believe we've spoken 
personally before.

11:58.610 --> 11:59.190
Who are you?

11:59.560 --> 12:02.020
Pardon my late introduction.

12:02.020 --> 12:06.190
I am Set, a humble justice.

12:06.190 --> 12:08.150
It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

12:08.490 --> 12:13.210
A judge? And what brings 
you here, Mr. Justice?

12:13.210 --> 12:15.990
Everyone in the palace 
is looking for His Majesty.

12:15.990 --> 12:16.620
Indeed.

12:17.150 --> 12:21.880
I turned back because I couldn't 
stop wondering about this room.

12:22.280 --> 12:25.770
And my instincts, it seems, 
have served me well.

12:26.000 --> 12:31.470
I sense someone's magic 
from within, albeit faintly.

12:31.470 --> 12:37.100
H-His Majesty, um, said that he wants 
to concentrate before the ceremony.

12:37.100 --> 12:41.580
Oh, but what good will that 
do if he arrives late?

12:41.870 --> 12:47.530
I have heard many desperate people 
speak in the course of my duties.

12:47.940 --> 12:51.740
And you, Lady Sariphi, are a poor liar.

12:52.050 --> 12:54.460
But please, do not misunderstand me.

12:54.790 --> 13:00.140
While the chancellor fears only 
an interruption in the ceremony,

13:00.140 --> 13:04.270
my concern is purely for His Majesty's safety.

13:04.270 --> 13:06.440
If he is experiencing any difficulty,

13:06.440 --> 13:09.400
I dearly wish to be of assistance.

13:09.630 --> 13:11.840
Surely you feel the same way.

13:12.560 --> 13:14.050
Now, Lady Sariphi,

13:14.440 --> 13:17.260
would you kindly open that door?

13:18.190 --> 13:18.820
No!

13:20.270 --> 13:22.350
Then I suppose I have no choice.

13:22.350 --> 13:27.340
I do not wish to manhandle one who may 
be our future queen, but needs must.

13:29.170 --> 13:32.160
Have no fear. They are my men.

13:32.430 --> 13:35.330
Now, open this door.

13:37.300 --> 13:38.300
Stop!

13:38.300 --> 13:38.910
Don't!

13:46.740 --> 13:48.250
Y-Your Majesty!

13:49.150 --> 13:51.290
A th-thousand pardons.

13:51.290 --> 13:53.930
I thought I'd find Your Majesty here.

13:54.240 --> 13:57.350
What have you been doing all this time?

13:59.180 --> 13:59.890
<i>The bell!</i>

14:00.470 --> 14:02.850
It seems I was a little too late.

14:02.850 --> 14:07.330
You will never arrive in time for the 
ceremony if you start dressing now.

14:07.590 --> 14:09.290
No, I will go as I am.

14:09.850 --> 14:10.930
Y-You mustn't.

14:10.930 --> 14:13.750
R-Respectfully, sire, 
you are hardly attired for—

14:13.750 --> 14:17.440
Whatever my appearance, I am king.

14:18.180 --> 14:20.040
Is that not so, Sariphi?

14:20.260 --> 14:21.050
Yup!

14:26.100 --> 14:28.460
The bell! It's almost time!

14:28.460 --> 14:31.550
I can't wait to see his regal figure again.

14:31.860 --> 14:33.220
Still, it's odd.

14:33.220 --> 14:37.010
The king usually comes out 
as soon as the bell rings,

14:37.330 --> 14:39.470
but I don't see him yet.

14:40.290 --> 14:42.000
It's hopeless now!

14:42.000 --> 14:42.930
Lord Chancellor...

14:43.630 --> 14:46.700
<i>He'll never make it! 
Now that it's come to this...</i>

14:47.030 --> 14:49.860
Stop the bell now! Cancel the ceremony!

14:49.860 --> 14:50.700
Lord Chancellor!

14:55.210 --> 14:58.000
It's the king! That's his holy beast!

14:59.590 --> 15:01.320
What divine splendor!

15:01.590 --> 15:03.340
Your Majesty!

15:03.750 --> 15:04.480
Huh?!

15:14.860 --> 15:17.840
Wh-What? He's not in full regalia.

15:17.840 --> 15:20.640
But Ozmargo's Grand Consecration 
is a time-honored tradition.

15:20.990 --> 15:23.370
Why would he come looking like that?

15:23.600 --> 15:26.060
<i>Your Majesty, what is the meaning of...</i>

15:41.900 --> 15:46.220
Today, I have cast off the armor 
of our founding king.

15:46.750 --> 15:50.630
But not out of disrespect for tradition.

15:51.050 --> 15:58.590
This realm is our first king's legacy. 
My duty is to defend and strengthen it.

15:59.010 --> 16:04.560
But I cannot do so by merely treading 
in the footsteps of my forefathers.

16:05.750 --> 16:10.070
Rigid adherence to precedent 
will leave it merely a shell,

16:10.070 --> 16:14.240
which will ultimately encase our 
minds in stubborn clannishness.

16:14.870 --> 16:18.480
To change for defense 
and defend through change:

16:18.480 --> 16:21.380
that is what it truly means to honor tradition.

16:21.810 --> 16:26.830
Unless we change, unless we progress, 
we can blaze no trails!

16:28.290 --> 16:34.140
Follow me! I shall clear the briars 
and forge a path for you to tread.

16:34.390 --> 16:39.070
It will lead us to the future 
we should strive for!

16:43.890 --> 16:45.100
Your Majesty!

16:44.240 --> 16:45.860
Long live the king!

16:45.860 --> 16:48.300
Ozmargo forever!

16:47.460 --> 16:49.280
Your Majesty!

16:48.490 --> 16:50.080
Your Majesty!

16:50.080 --> 16:51.320
Your Majesty!

16:51.800 --> 16:54.020
Long live the king!

16:54.760 --> 16:56.660
<i>His Majesty is amazing.</i>

16:58.330 --> 17:01.480
What a lovely speech that was, Lady Sariphi.

17:02.730 --> 17:04.290
Lady Sariphi?

17:04.640 --> 17:05.620
<i>I want to go.</i>

17:06.020 --> 17:07.070
<i>I...</i>

17:07.720 --> 17:10.010
<i>I want to be there, too.</i>

17:11.510 --> 17:13.360
<i>At his side.</i>

17:15.210 --> 17:17.670
A magnificent address, sire.

17:17.670 --> 17:23.770
But when you make such bold plans, I wish 
you would inform me of them beforehand.

17:24.510 --> 17:27.370
You would have objected if I'd told you.

17:27.700 --> 17:28.200
Besides...

17:28.200 --> 17:29.140
Sire!

17:32.780 --> 17:36.070
Something Sariphi said gave me the idea.

17:36.470 --> 17:41.090
A king must do more than dress 
magnificently for his people.

17:41.700 --> 17:43.160
No wonder, then.

17:43.160 --> 17:45.840
I, Anubis, am deeply impressed.

17:46.600 --> 17:49.320
Mr. Chancellor gave me a normal compliment.

17:49.980 --> 17:54.060
I thought you'd be waiting to 
bully me with another ordeal.

17:54.060 --> 17:56.740
Another day, perhaps.

17:58.610 --> 18:01.270
For the present, your ordeals are at an end.

18:01.270 --> 18:02.210
Huh?

18:02.980 --> 18:08.770
But all I've done is summon Bennu 
and entertain Duke Galois.

18:09.180 --> 18:15.640
Henceforth, you will take your place 
as acting queen consort.

18:15.640 --> 18:17.780
<i>Acting</i> queen consort?

18:18.000 --> 18:19.260
Precisely.

18:19.260 --> 18:24.690
But I ask that you nevertheless perform 
all of a queen's public duties.

18:25.160 --> 18:30.090
Should you do so without incident 
until the next Grand Consecration,

18:30.090 --> 18:33.990
we shall recognize you 
as queen consort in full.

18:34.850 --> 18:39.440
However, your public presence 
as acting queen consort

18:39.800 --> 18:43.460
will naturally entail revealing 
your existence to the people.

18:43.850 --> 18:47.380
Harsh protest from many 
quarters will be unavoidable.

18:47.660 --> 18:50.960
If you should fail to perform 
your queenly duties

18:50.960 --> 18:55.530
and seriously tarnish 
His Majesty's reputation,

18:55.530 --> 18:58.140
I shall return you to Yoana.

18:59.370 --> 19:01.810
To the human realm?

19:02.220 --> 19:06.530
That said, there is a way 
for you to remain in this land.

19:06.530 --> 19:10.630
You could decline to become 
acting queen consort.

19:10.630 --> 19:14.350
In that case, I will ask His Majesty 
to take a formal wife.

19:14.350 --> 19:15.410
And you...

19:15.760 --> 19:19.880
may have a position as His Majesty's pet.

19:26.560 --> 19:32.450
<i>This is Sariphi's dilemma. 
All I can do is accept</i>

19:33.280 --> 19:36.400
<i>the answer her heart gives.</i>

19:36.950 --> 19:39.930
<i>This is a considerable gamble 
for me, as well.</i>

19:40.310 --> 19:41.590
<i>Now, what will you do,</i>

19:41.590 --> 19:42.700
<i>wench?</i>

19:44.540 --> 19:48.720
<i>If I agree to be acting queen 
consort and can't do it right,</i>

19:48.720 --> 19:51.320
<i>I won't even be allowed 
to live in this realm.</i>

19:51.800 --> 19:55.830
<i>If I give up on becoming queen, 
I can at least stay here.</i>

19:57.140 --> 19:57.960
<i>But...</i>

20:02.980 --> 20:03.890
Hey.

20:04.720 --> 20:07.020
Huh? Bennu?

20:07.020 --> 20:09.530
What're you brooding for?

20:09.530 --> 20:11.220
You know what you gotta say.

20:13.670 --> 20:16.520
Go on. Queen it up.

20:16.910 --> 20:20.750
This country's like a big, stagnant pool.

20:20.750 --> 20:24.870
You'll never get anywhere unless 
you make a splash and stir things up.

20:27.200 --> 20:28.080
But...

20:28.840 --> 20:29.950
Missy,

20:31.290 --> 20:33.800
clench your teeth for me, wouldya?

20:33.800 --> 20:34.490
Huh?

20:37.540 --> 20:39.430
Well?! Hurts, doesn't it?!

20:39.510 --> 20:41.630
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

20:39.510 --> 20:41.630
<b>In no pain
whatsoever</b>

20:39.670 --> 20:41.400
Huh? Nope.

20:41.400 --> 20:45.370
Well, the wingtip I socked you with 
sure does, nincompoop!

20:45.620 --> 20:48.940
You're no sorry excuse 
for a sacrifice anymore.

20:48.940 --> 20:50.980
So hold your head high and say,

20:50.980 --> 20:55.680
"I'm the only one who can make 
His Majesty into a great king!"

20:57.100 --> 20:58.720
Only me?

20:59.390 --> 21:00.470
Remember this:

21:00.870 --> 21:04.900
the only woman I desire is you, Sariphi.

21:06.530 --> 21:07.640
<i>That's right.</i>

21:17.120 --> 21:19.740
<i>Leo only wants me.</i>

21:23.050 --> 21:26.770
Wen—Lady Sariphi, 
where did you come from?

21:27.250 --> 21:28.960
Your Majesty! I'll do it!

21:29.590 --> 21:33.780
I don't know if I'll be any good, 
but I'll be the best acting queen I can!

21:34.510 --> 21:35.470
So...

21:36.040 --> 21:38.050
So have faith and be patient!

21:38.510 --> 21:39.940
Let me stay with you!

21:42.390 --> 21:44.090
I've been waiting for that answer.

21:45.480 --> 21:49.990
Your previous ordeals 
were assigned to you alone.

21:49.990 --> 21:53.570
I could only gnash my teeth and watch.

21:54.640 --> 22:00.480
But a king shares responsibility with 
his chosen consort, acting or not.

22:00.910 --> 22:03.040
This is a test of me, as well.

22:03.500 --> 22:08.260
Sariphi, I will always be with you.

22:09.260 --> 22:10.960
<i>From now on, the two of us</i>

22:12.510 --> 22:14.860
<i>will share the same burden.</i>

23:26.100 --> 23:30.180
You <i>accepted</i> the post?! 
You've gone too far, wench!

23:30.180 --> 23:32.810
I hope you disgrace yourself on your first—

23:32.810 --> 23:34.650
What is this strange presence I sense?!

23:34.650 --> 23:38.320
Lord Chancellor, would you 
care for one of my amulets?

23:37.060 --> 23:40.050
Next Episode

23:37.060 --> 23:40.050
Divine Protection and the Acting Queen Consort

23:38.320 --> 23:39.810
No, thank you.
